    LLM: 'The judge reveals an adjective, all other players submit a red noun card face down, and the judge picks the funniest or best match. The winning submitter keeps the prompt as a point.',
    Player: 'The judge reveals an adjective, all other players submit a red noun card face down, and the judge picks the funniest or best match. The winning submitter keeps the prompt as a point.',
    objective: 'Win enough green cards by submitting the noun card the judge prefers for each prompt.',
    gameplay: 'The judge reveals an adjective, all other players submit a red noun card face down, and the judge picks the funniest or best match. The winning submitter keeps the prompt as a point.',
    keyRules: [
      'One player judges each round.',
      'Players submit red cards secretly.',
      'The judge chooses the best match subjectively.',
      'Collected green cards are points.',
    ],
